{#-
  A change the owner made mid story that holds from now on, as Procreator is told it: a note at the
  end of the scene's session, read with the next message (breading_ground.ts). Each thing that
  changed, and each of its fields as it was and as it is now. A change to Procreator's memory is
  about the work, not the story, and says so. Takes a ChangeNoteView.
-#}
<owner_change>
{% if memory %}
The owner changed your memory, your notes to yourself about the work. Keep to it from now on, as you would to your own notes.
{% else %}
The owner changed the story at this point. It holds from now on: play it as something that has just happened, or has just come to light, and keep to it from here. What was played before it stays as it was.
{% endif %}
{% for c in changed %}
<changed subject="{{ c.subject }}">
{% for f in c.fields %}
<field name="{{ f.name }}">
<was>{{ f.was if f.was else 'Nothing.' }}</was>
<now>{{ f.now if f.now else 'Nothing.' }}</now>
</field>
{% endfor %}
</changed>
{% endfor %}
</owner_change>
